the offering price. Our share repurchase program is designed to provide
stockholders who have held their shares for at least one year with a way to
liquidate their investment. The price at which shares may be sold back to us
will depend on how long the stockholder has owned the shares.

Q: WHAT WILL YOU DO WITH THE PROCEEDS FROM THIS OFFERING?

A: Our use of proceeds will depend on the number of shares sold in the offering.
After paying the fees and expenses of the offering, we plan to use the remaining
