considered a return of capital for tax purposes. These amounts will not be
subject to tax immediately but will instead reduce the tax basis of your
investment in effect deferring a portion of your tax until you sell your shares
or we liquidate. Because each investor's tax implications are different, you
should consult with your tax advisor.

